      "show_in_quick_glance": true,
      "text": "<p>During&nbsp;our&nbsp;visit&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;museum,&nbsp;we&nbsp;were&nbsp;fascinated&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;well-preserved&nbsp;skeleton&nbsp;of&nbsp;an&nbsp;auroch&nbsp;and&nbsp;how&nbsp;its&nbsp;scars&nbsp;revealed&nbsp;the&nbsp;story&nbsp;of&nbsp;a&nbsp;failed&nbsp;hunting&nbsp;attempt.&nbsp;Inspired&nbsp;by&nbsp;this&nbsp;discovery,&nbsp;we&nbsp;designed&nbsp;a&nbsp;serious&nbsp;game&nbsp;intended&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;dramatic&nbsp;and&nbsp;emotionally&nbsp;engaging&nbsp;by&nbsp;using&nbsp;a&nbsp;combination&nbsp;of&nbsp;endless&nbsp;runner,&nbsp;exploration,&nbsp;and&nbsp;tracking&nbsp;mechanics.</p>",
