      "after_image": null,
      "show_in_quick_glance": true,
      "text": "<p>As&nbsp;a&nbsp;narrative&nbsp;designer,&nbsp;I&nbsp;had&nbsp;to&nbsp;ensure&nbsp;that&nbsp;our&nbsp;story&nbsp;remained&nbsp;impactful&nbsp;while&nbsp;fitting&nbsp;into&nbsp;our&nbsp;gameplay&nbsp;mechanics.&nbsp;For&nbsp;that&nbsp;reason,&nbsp;I&nbsp;proposed&nbsp;opening&nbsp;the&nbsp;game&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;storytelling&nbsp;technique&nbsp;known&nbsp;as&nbsp;<em>in&nbsp;medias&nbsp;res</em>:&nbsp;a&nbsp;brief&nbsp;moment&nbsp;of&nbsp;calm&nbsp;that&nbsp;is&nbsp;suddenly&nbsp;interrupted&nbsp;by&nbsp;a&nbsp;group&nbsp;of&nbsp;hunters&nbsp;ambushing&nbsp;our&nbsp;protagonists.&nbsp;This&nbsp;way,&nbsp;we&nbsp;achieve&nbsp;catching&nbsp;immediately&nbsp;the&nbsp;players&#39;&nbsp;attention&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;gameplay&nbsp;starts&nbsp;in&nbsp;plain&nbsp;action,&nbsp;escaping&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;hunters&#39;&nbsp;dogs.</p>",
