      "show_in_quick_glance": true,
      "text": "<p>For&nbsp;the&nbsp;introductory&nbsp;cinematic,&nbsp;I&nbsp;worked&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;atmospheric&nbsp;lighting,&nbsp;VFX,&nbsp;and&nbsp;several&nbsp;in-engine&nbsp;animations,&nbsp;as&nbsp;well&nbsp;as&nbsp;the&nbsp;composition&nbsp;and&nbsp;rendering.&nbsp;My&nbsp;goal&nbsp;with&nbsp;these&nbsp;shots&nbsp;was&nbsp;to&nbsp;tell&nbsp;the&nbsp;story&nbsp;through&nbsp;brief&nbsp;but&nbsp;visually&nbsp;striking&nbsp;moments.&nbsp;After&nbsp;rendering,&nbsp;I&nbsp;edited&nbsp;the&nbsp;sequence,&nbsp;added&nbsp;sound&nbsp;effects,&nbsp;and&nbsp;applied&nbsp;the&nbsp;necessary&nbsp;post-processing&nbsp;adjustments.</p>",
