  "contributions": "<p>In&nbsp;this&nbsp;collaboration&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;Stone&nbsp;Age&nbsp;department&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nationalmuseet.dk/en\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">National&nbsp;Museum&nbsp;of&nbsp;Denmark</a>&nbsp;we&nbsp;focused&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;concept&nbsp;of&nbsp;<strong>archaeogames</strong>,&nbsp;exploring&nbsp;how&nbsp;video&nbsp;games&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;used&nbsp;for&nbsp;archaeological&nbsp;research&nbsp;and&nbsp;public&nbsp;engagement.</p>",
